---
import CommunityLayout from '../../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
---
<CommunityLayout title="发布相亲帖">
  <section data-view="editor" class="community-shell"><div class="community-main">
    <a href="/meet" class="community-back" data-astro-reload>返回相亲广场</a>
    <p class="community-eyebrow">新启事 <em>NEW POST</em></p><h1>写一则相亲贴</h1>
    <p id="community-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="community-message">正在检查登录状态…</p>
    <form id="post-form" class="community-form" hidden>
      <section class="compose-step"><span class="compose-step-number">01</span><div class="compose-step-fields"><h2>基本信息 <small>BASICS</small></h2><fieldset class="form-grid"><legend class="sr-only">基本资料</legend>
        <label>昵称<input name="nickname" required maxlength="30" autocomplete="nickname" /></label>
        <label>年龄<input name="age" type="number" min="18" max="100" step="1" required /></label>
        <label>城市<input name="city" required maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：杭州" /></label>
        <label>性别<select name="gender" aria-label="性别" required><option value="">请选择</option><option>女</option><option>男</option><option>其他</option></select></label>
        <label class="full-width">职业方向（选填）<input name="occupation" maxlength="60" /></label>
      </fieldset>
      <label>标题<input name="title" required minlength="2" maxlength="60" placeholder="用一句话介绍自己" /></label>
      </div></section>
      <section class="compose-step"><span class="compose-step-number">02</span><div class="compose-step-fields"><h2>关于你 <small>ABOUT</small></h2>
      <label>关于我<textarea name="about" rows="7" required minlength="20" maxlength="2000" placeholder="你的生活、兴趣，以及现在的自己（至少 20 字）"></textarea></label>
      <label>希望认识的你（选填）<textarea name="looking_for" rows="4" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
      <div id="photo-editor"><p class="section-label">照片（选填） <span id="photo-counter">0 / 6</span></p><div class="photo-editor-row"><div id="photo-editor-list"></div><div id="photo-add"></div></div><input id="photo-files" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple hidden aria-label="选择照片" /><p class="community-note">最多 6 张，每张不超过 10 MB。审核通过后，照片可公开浏览。</p><p id="photo-message" class="community-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
      </div></section>
      <section class="compose-step"><span class="compose-step-number">03</span><div class="compose-step-fields"><h2>联系方式 <small>CONTACT</small></h2>
      <label>联系方式（选填）<input name="contact" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如：微信号或联系邮箱" /></label>
      <label class="check-row"><input name="share_contact" type="checkbox" /><span>我同意审核通过后，将上述联系方式公开展示给所有访客（无需登录即可看到）；他人可能保存这些信息。</span></label>
      <label class="check-row"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required /><span>我已年满 18 周岁，资料与照片属于本人且真实；同意审核通过后向所有访客公开展示基本资料、正文和照片，有效期 30 天。请勿填写详细住址或身份证信息。</span></label>
      </div></section>
      <p id="post-cooldown" class="community-note" hidden></p>
      <div class="community-actions compose-submit"><button type="submit" class="community-button">提交审核</button><a href="/account" class="community-link" data-astro-reload>我的帖子</a></div>
    </form>
    </div><aside class="community-side"><section><h2>审核 / REVIEW</h2><div class="community-note community-aside-note"><ol><li>资料与照片一并人工审核。</li><li>编辑已发布的帖子后，需重新审核。</li><li>30 天到期后，可编辑后重新提交。</li></ol></div></section><section><h2>隐私 / PRIVACY</h2><p class="community-note">请勿上传证件、他人照片或包含详细住址的信息。审核通过后的照片可被访客查看和保存，请谨慎发布。</p></section></aside>
  </section>
</CommunityLayout>
